flowchart TD
    %% Rossum Human Review and Correction Workflow
    Start([Operator Opens Document in Queue]) --> ViewWorkspace[Split-Screen Workspace Loads: Left Viewer + Right Data Panel]
    ViewWorkspace --> CheckStatus{Inspect Validation Status Badge}
    
    CheckStatus -- "0 Errors / Valid" --> QuickScan[Review Key Values: Vendor, Amount, Line Total]
    CheckStatus -- "Errors / Missing Fields Flagged" --> FocusError[System Auto-Focuses on First Error Field]
    
    QuickScan --> FastConfirm[Click Confirm or Press Space/Enter]
    
    FocusError --> InspectDoc[Viewer Automatically Centers & Highlights Candidate Region via SVG Box]
    InspectDoc --> EditMethod{Choose Input Mechanism}
    
    EditMethod -- "Direct Keyboard Entry" --> TypeInput[Type corrected text into floating editBoxInput]
    EditMethod -- "Canvas Point-and-Click" --> ClickCanvas[Click or Drag bounding box directly on PDF document text]
    
    TypeInput --> ValidateField{Instant Field Validation}
    ClickCanvas --> PopulateValue[AI extracts OCR text into field] --> ValidateField
    
    ValidateField -- "Still Invalid / Format Error" --> ShowHelper[Render In-line Helper & Error Alert] --> EditMethod
    ValidateField -- "Resolved" --> DecrementError[Error Counter Decrements: 1 to 0]
    
    DecrementError --> NextField{More Fields to Review?}
    NextField -- "Yes (Tab navigation)" --> ViewWorkspace
    NextField -- "No (All fields green)" --> FastConfirm
    
    FastConfirm --> FeedbackModal[Capture Operator Satisfaction: Angry/Neutral/In Love]
    FeedbackModal --> AutoAdvance[Auto-Navigate to Next Document in Queue]
